msgid ""
"Force ETS2LA to load the map on game startup. This can resolve issues where "
"your game.log.txt is not where ETS2LA expects it."
msgstr ""
"Pakota ETS2LA lataaman pelin karttadata heti kun se käynnistyy. Voi korjata "
"ongelmia joissa pelilokisi (game.log.txt) ei ole oletetussa paikassa."

