"Subscriptions will <span class=\"font-bold text-text-accent\">never</span> "
"be required for using ETS2LA. They are a way you can support the development."
msgstr ""
"Tilaaminen ei tule <span class=\"font-bold text-text-accent\">koskaan</span> "
